# Prologue, present day: Raka in Bandung, then Dinda reaches him.

@conversation p_bandung chapter=Prolog chapter.en=Prologue title="Sekarang" title.en="Now" checkpoint
@scene VN bg=bg_raka_room_night.webp music=amb_room_night.mp3 day=0 time=02:02 textbox=nvl

narration
  id: Setahun kemudian. Bandung, jam dua pagi.
  en: A year later. Bandung, two in the morning.
narration
  id: Kamar kos tiga kali empat. Kasur di lantai, rice cooker di pojok, dan laptop yang kipasnya bunyi kayak mau terbang.
  en: A three-by-four rented room. A mattress on the floor, a rice cooker in the corner, and a laptop whose fan sounds like it's about to take off.
narration
  id: Kerjaan gue sekarang ngedit audio iklan. Suara orang senyum-senyum jualan asuransi. Gue potong napasnya, gue rapihin "eee"-nya, gue kirim. Lima puluh ribu per menit jadi.
  en: These days I edit audio for ads. People smiling their way through insurance pitches. I cut their breaths, clean up their "umm"s, send it off. Fifty thousand rupiah per finished minute.
narration
  id: Kerjaannya rapi. Bosnya puas. Gue nggak pernah inget satu pun isinya.
  en: The work is clean. The client's happy. I never remember a single word of it.

stage
  textbox adv

narration
  id: Di tab sebelah, kebuka dari tadi sore, ada satu hal yang gue nggak berani tutup.
  en: In the next tab, open since this afternoon, is the one thing I can't bring myself to close.
narration
  id: "Suara Pesisir, Episode 11." Diunggah tiga minggu lalu. Empat ratus dua belas kali diputar.
  en: "Suara Pesisir, Episode 11." Uploaded three weeks ago. Four hundred and twelve plays.
narration
  id: Pendengarnya udah dua kali lipat. Gue nggak tahu harus ngerasa apa soal itu.
  en: Her listeners have doubled. I don't know how to feel about that.

choice PLAY_EP by=raka:sad silent
  id: Putar episodenya?
  en: Play the episode?
? Putar. | Play it.
  value play
? Tutup tabnya. Kali ini beneran. | Close the tab. For real this time.
  value close

narration [if PLAY_EP == 'close']
  id: Kursor gue udah di tanda silang. Udah setahun kursor gue di situ.{w} Jari gue malah ngeklik tombol putar.
  en: My cursor is already on the X. It's been there for a year.{w} My finger clicks play instead.

sekar voice=vo_p_sekar_01.mp3 [offstage]
  id: Halo, pendengar Suara Pesisir. Gue Sekar, dan ini episode sebelas. Malam ini kita ngobrol sama ibu-ibu pengupas kerang di Muara Angke.
  en: Hi, Suara Pesisir listeners. I'm Sekar, and this is episode eleven. Tonight we're talking with the women who shell mussels in Muara Angke.
  delivery: bright podcast intro, a little playful, recorded close to the mic
sekar voice=vo_p_sekar_02.mp3 [offstage]
  id: Mereka kerja dari subuh, tangannya penuh luka kecil, dan tiap tahun kerangnya makin sedikit. Kenapa? Nah. Itu yang mau kita cari tahu.
  en: They work from before dawn, their hands covered in tiny cuts, and every year there are fewer mussels. Why? Well. That's what we're going to find out.
  delivery: warm, then curious, leaning in on the question

narration
  id: Audionya bersih. Anginnya nggak bunyi kayak pesawat jatuh.{w} Siapa pun yang ngedit sekarang, dia lebih rajin dari gue.
  en: The audio is clean. The wind doesn't sound like a plane crash.{w} Whoever edits it now is more careful than I ever was.

sekar voice=vo_p_sekar_03.mp3 [offstage]
  id: Oh iya. Episode dua belas lagi gue garap. Yang ini... beda. Doain ya.
  en: Oh, and. I'm working on episode twelve. This one is... different. Wish me luck.
  delivery: the playfulness drops, quieter, almost nervous

stage
  sound sfx_msg_receive.mp3

narration
  id: HP gue bunyi. Jam dua lewat empat belas.{w} Nggak ada yang ngechat gue jam segini. Nggak ada yang ngechat gue, titik.
  en: My phone buzzes. Fourteen minutes past two.{w} Nobody texts me at this hour. Nobody texts me, period.

-> p_now


@conversation p_now chapter=Prolog chapter.en=Prologue title="Pesan Masuk" title.en="Incoming"
@scene CHAT channel=thread_dinda day=0 time=02:14 music=amb_room_night.mp3

timestamp
  id: Bandung, 02.14
  en: Bandung, 2:14 AM

dinda typing=1.8s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: ka
  en: ka
dinda typing=2.6s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: ini dinda. adeknya kak sekar
  en: it's dinda. sekar's sister
dinda typing=3.4s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: maaf jam segini. lo masih pake nomor ini kan?
  en: sorry it's so late. you still use this number right?

choice FIRST_REPLY by=dinda silent
  id: Dinda masih mengetik...
  en: Dinda is still typing...
? Din? Ada apa? | Din? What's going on?
  value worried
  +trust_dinda 2
? Iya. Kenapa? | Yeah. Why?
  value guarded

player sfx=sfx_msg_send.mp3 [if FIRST_REPLY == 'worried']
  id: din? ada apa?
  en: din? what's going on?
player sfx=sfx_msg_send.mp3 [if FIRST_REPLY == 'guarded']
  id: iya. kenapa?
  en: yeah. why?

dinda typing=4.2s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: kak sekar ilang. udah 3 hari
  en: sekar's missing. 3 days now
dinda typing=2.2s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: boleh gue telpon? susah ngetiknya
  en: can i call you? it's hard to type this

-> p_call


@conversation p_call chapter=Prolog chapter.en=Prologue title="Telepon Dinda" title.en="Dinda's Call"
@scene CALL channel=thread_dinda day=0 time=02:17 bg=bg_raka_room_night.webp music=amb_room_night.mp3

system sfx=sfx_phone_ring.mp3
  id: Dinda memanggil…
  en: Dinda is calling…
wait 2.2s
system
  id: Tersambung
  en: Connected

dinda voice=vo_p_dinda_01.mp3
  id: Ka? Sori. Gue tahu kalian udah nggak ngomong. Gue nggak tahu harus nelpon siapa lagi.
  en: Ka? Sorry. I know you two don't talk anymore. I didn't know who else to call.
  delivery: shaky, trying to sound steady, late at night
dinda voice=vo_p_dinda_02.mp3
  id: Senin malem dia pamit mau rekaman. Abis itu HP-nya mati. Motornya masih di rumah. Dompetnya juga.
  en: Monday night she said she was going out to record. After that her phone went dead. Her scooter's still at home. Her wallet too.
  delivery: listing facts quickly, holding it together

choice CALL_REACT by=dinda
  id: Apa yang lo bilang?
  en: What do you say?
? Polisi udah dikabarin? | Have you told the police?
  value police
  +trust_dinda 3
? Mungkin dia cuma butuh waktu sendiri. | Maybe she just needs some time alone.
  value alone
  -trust_dinda 3
? Lo sekarang di mana? Lo aman? | Where are you now? Are you safe?
  value safe
  +trust_dinda 5

dinda voice=vo_p_dinda_03.mp3 [if CALL_REACT == 'police']
  id: Udah. Mereka bilang tunggu. Katanya cewek umur dua puluh dua kabur dari rumah itu biasa.
  en: Yeah. They said to wait. They said a twenty-two-year-old girl running away from home is normal.
  delivery: bitter, tired
dinda voice=vo_p_dinda_04.mp3 [if CALL_REACT == 'alone']
  id: Itu yang polisi bilang. Gue kira lo beda.
  en: That's what the police said. I thought you'd be different.
  delivery: hurt, cold
dinda voice=vo_p_dinda_05.mp3 [if CALL_REACT == 'safe']
  id: Gue di rumah. Sama Ibu. Ibu nggak tidur dari Senin.{w} Makasih udah nanya.
  en: I'm at home. With Mom. Mom hasn't slept since Monday.{w} Thanks for asking.
  delivery: surprised, softening

dinda voice=vo_p_dinda_06.mp3
  id: Ka, dengerin. Tadi siang HP cadangannya Kak Sekar nyala sebentar di kamarnya. Ada satu pesan keluar yang nggak terkirim.
  en: Ka, listen. This afternoon Sekar's spare phone turned on for a moment in her room. There was one outgoing message that never went through.
  delivery: lower, careful
dinda voice=vo_p_dinda_07.mp3
  id: Buat lo.
  en: To you.
  delivery: quiet

player
  id: Isinya apa?
  en: What does it say?

dinda voice=vo_p_dinda_08.mp3
  id: "Ka. Inget jam lima pagi itu? Gue masih di sana."
  en: "Ka. Remember five in the morning? I'm still there."
  delivery: reading slowly off a screen
dinda voice=vo_p_dinda_09.mp3
  id: Gue nggak ngerti maksudnya. Lo ngerti?
  en: I don't get it. Do you?
  delivery: hopeful, pleading

choice ANSWER by=dinda timeout=10s
  id: Jam lima pagi. Dermaga Muara Angke.
  en: Five in the morning. The Muara Angke pier.
? Gue ngerti. Gue ke Jakarta sekarang. | I get it. I'm coming to Jakarta now.
  value now
  +trust_dinda 5
? Nggak tahu. Tapi gue ke sana besok. | No idea. But I'll come tomorrow.
  value tomorrow
? ... | ... [default] [silent]
  value silent
  -trust_dinda 2

dinda voice=vo_p_dinda_10.mp3 [if ANSWER == 'now']
  id: Sekarang? Ini jam dua pagi, Ka.{w} ...Oke. Gue tunggu di rumah.
  en: Now? It's two in the morning, Ka.{w} ...Okay. I'll be waiting at home.
  delivery: stunned, then relieved
dinda voice=vo_p_dinda_11.mp3 [if ANSWER == 'tomorrow']
  id: Oke. Gue tunggu di rumah. Jangan nggak dateng.
  en: Okay. I'll be at home, waiting. Don't not show up.
  delivery: wary, half joking
dinda voice=vo_p_dinda_12.mp3 [if ANSWER == 'silent']
  id: Ka? Halo? ...Dia selalu bilang lo kabur kalau ada yang berat. Jangan kali ini.
  en: Ka? Hello? ...She always said you run when things get heavy. Not this time.
  delivery: frustrated, almost crying

system
  id: Panggilan berakhir
  en: Call ended

-> p_after


